Table full name: mitelman-db.prod.CytogenInvValid
Column name: RefNo Type: INT64 Description: reference number
Column name: CaseNo Type: STRING Description: case number -- usually an intger, but can also be an arbitrary string
Column name: InvNo Type: INT64 Description: investigation number -- always an integer between 1 and 9
Column name: KaryLength Type: INT64 Description: length of the karyotype description -- can be as long as thousands of characters, but is usually < 30
Column name: KaryShort Type: STRING Description: short (possibly truncated) karyotype description
Column name: KaryLong Type: STRING Description: if the karyotype description exceeds a certain length, the full string is in this column, otherwise this field is null
Column name: Message Type: STRING Description: Indicates if the karyotype has been corrected by the syntax checker
Column name: Reason Type: STRING Description: Error Messages
